 * userspace API through ioctl commands defined in the shared UAPI header
 * include/{{ module_name }}.h:
 *
 *   {{ name_upper }}_IOCG_INFO  - read device state
 *   {{ name_upper }}_IOCS_GAIN  - set gain (validated)
 *   {{ name_upper }}_IOC_RESET  - reset state
 *
 * No real hardware is required; bind it via the provided Device Tree overlay.
